# Media Library local storage (uploaded originals + generated variants).
#
# TEMPORARY, DEMO ONLY: storage/media is committed so the Render free-tier
# demo has its images/PDFs. Render's free plan has an ephemeral filesystem and
# no persistent disk, and it deploys from git - so anything not committed is
# gone on every restart/sleep. The Dockerfile bakes this directory into the
# image.
#
# This is a deliberate trade, not the intended design: it puts ~287MB in git
# history, and uploads made *at runtime* are still lost on restart. The real
# fix is object storage (S3/R2) via StorageAdapter - see DEPLOYMENT.md. When
# that lands (or when moving to AWS), re-ignore this directory.
/storage/*
!/storage/media
